VERSION 120
CREATE BUTTON_DEFINITIONS

BUTTON NX_SKILL_CONTROL_READ_DRAWING
LABEL Read Drawing...
TOOLBAR_LABEL Read Drawing
MESSAGE Pick a drawing, photo or reference image: read it with the local image pipeline, print the measurements, and hand it to Copilot.
NO_REPEAT
ACCELERATOR Ctrl+Alt+Shift+I
ACTIONS read_drawing.py

BUTTON NX_SKILL_CONTROL_REVIEW_PLAN
LABEL Review Plan
TOOLBAR_LABEL Review Plan
MESSAGE Opens the human-paced review dialog: run agent-planned steps one at a time, watch each change, and undo any step.
NO_REPEAT
ACCELERATOR Ctrl+Alt+Shift+R
ACTIONS nx_review_executor.py

BUTTON NX_SKILL_CONTROL_START_BRIDGE
LABEL Start NX Skill Live Bridge
TOOLBAR_LABEL Start NX Skill Live Bridge
MESSAGE Starts the local NX skill live bridge inside the current NX process.
NO_REPEAT
ACCELERATOR Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B
ACTIONS nx_start_live_bridge.py

BUTTON NX_SKILL_CONTROL_CREATE_TEST_PART
LABEL Create NX Skill Smoke Part
TOOLBAR_LABEL Create NX Skill Smoke Part
MESSAGE Creates a visible smoke-test modeling part in the current NX window.
NO_REPEAT
ACCELERATOR Ctrl+Alt+Shift+N
ACTIONS create_smoke_part.py

BUTTON NX_SKILL_CONTROL_OPEN_COPILOT
LABEL Copilot (Local)...
TOOLBAR_LABEL Copilot
